      // shader function keyed off uTime + aRibbonProgress, not a JS-driven
      // wave loop — there is no equivalent of initLabWave() to call here
      // any more. Its uHeroRibbonProgress activity gate is still driven
      // automatically by animate()'s generic progressDrivenStyles() loop
      // (particle-animation-loop.js) whenever 'ribbon-dispersed-pulse' is
      // the current/next shape, same as every other shape-driven style —
      // nothing page-init-time needs to happen for it to work.

      if (!window.__lowEndDevice) {
      // (work-cards — the post-card grid just above Lab — is the one
      // section-level particle trigger that's deliberately NOT a zone
      // here. See main.js's initCardParticleMorphing() for why: its shape
