          // scrolling up right until it's off-screen, not pause partway.
          // The second-half climb covers 14 units (not 7) over the same
          // 0.50 span, so it's moving at twice the original rate — faster
          // throughout, not just at the end — and it's already well past
          // the top edge (~6.1) before t=1.0, so the extra distance beyond
          // that is travelled off-screen, not visible.
          // Shape: self-contained entrance AND exit — no reference to any
          // OTHER section's own shape choice, so Lab keeps working
          // correctly regardless of what comes before or after it (sections
          // may be reordered). Silent (no opinion) until t=0.05 — see
          // _sampleShape()'s own doc on why a keyframe partway through a
          // zone's range must NOT sit at t=0: an early claim here would
          // hijack whatever an EARLIER section (hero, or anything else) is
          // still legitimately showing, the exact bug this pattern already
          // fixed for operating-model-exit/testimonials. t=0.05 ~roughly
