          // 'footer-exit'/'profile-exit''s existing per-section-exit
          // pattern — deliberately NOT the 'lab' key itself (which stays
          // visible, never 'hide', so the entrance morph above always
          // shows). Per-keyframe morphMs=400 (fast, "hide is never really
          // seen") overrides the zone's own 800ms (chosen for the SLOW,
