            //
            // Safe to remove: verified the zone's remaining shape keyframe
            // (the exit at 0.60+labHoldFrac) still hides going down, and
            // reverseExit still fires going up — _sampleShape() is simply
            // silent for the whole approach, which is the "no opinion"
            // state, not a broken one.
