            // early release while Lab was still visibly in view. Held open
            // past t=1 by the SAME labHoldFrac used for the exit keyframes
            // above, so position ownership and the exit-hide trigger stay
            // in lockstep — releasing one without the other was the earlier
            // bug (hide fired at its old fixed t=0.60 while ownsPosition
