        // page instead of sitting static. #footer is the very last element
        // on every page (default.hbs), so it can never fully "scroll past"
        // like Lab does — the page simply stops scrolling once its bottom
        // reaches the viewport bottom. Verified live: at the true page
        // bottom this zone's own progress lands around ~0.4, not 1.0 — so
        // the resting keyframe is placed at 0.42 (not 1.00), which is where
        // it actually settles once you can't scroll any further, per
